WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:06.256
Allow me to introduce my Spirit Ally.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:08.967
Blamuro, the vampire hunter.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:10.510
And I

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:13.346
am Boris Tepes Dracula.

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.931
A vampire.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.933
A vampire hunter

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.268
and Dracula?

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:22.272
Cut the crap! Dracula is
a fictional character from a novel!

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.065
Besides, if anyone's Dracula,

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.776
it's got to be that geezer over there!

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:28.862
Yes, you're right!

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:31.406
It's his hair and his beard!

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:35.410
There are only five of them,
so why do they have two of the same type?

00:00:35.994 --> 00:00:37.287
Man, that's lame!

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.664
You won't get away with that!

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:42.250
Being likened to such
a shabby-looking man as he

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:44.210
is the gravest insult!

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.378
What?

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.010
Now my unique identity is protected.

00:00:55.346 --> 00:00:57.307
Forgive me, Damayaji.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:00.685
It's all their fault

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.687
for uttering such malicious slander.

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:05.607
My friend, please do me the kindness

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.610
of living on in me
to give me your strength…

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.281
for all eternity.

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:18.203
-What's with him?
-Those guys…

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:19.537
Their friend just died,

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:22.082
but they haven't even batted an eyelid.

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.834
I'm sorry. This is a bad habit of mine.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:27.378
I let my emotions get the better of me.

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:28.797
Don't worry about it.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.216
We don't need weaklings.

00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:34.719
Just make sure you fight well enough
to make up the numbers.

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:36.930
Yoh…

00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:38.431
Lyserg!

00:01:39.015 --> 00:01:40.100
Are you all right?

00:01:40.683 --> 00:01:43.103
I'm so cold…

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.314
I feel like I could
lose consciousness any minute…

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:49.234
Those bitten by my fangs

00:01:49.317 --> 00:01:51.611
become vampires themselves, loyal to me.

00:01:51.694 --> 00:01:54.239
What are you saying?

00:01:54.322 --> 00:01:58.284
What's Dracula doing out here
in broad daylight, anyway?

00:01:58.368 --> 00:01:59.536
Silence!

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.789
What would a foolish human know?

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:08.837
In what world could a creature that turns
to dust in the sunlight possibly exist?

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:13.341
In what world could a creature that has
its eyes burned by the cross exist?

00:02:13.925 --> 00:02:16.302
Don't you dare liken me to a fantasy

00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:18.346
conceived of by foolish humans!

00:02:21.933 --> 00:02:25.061
First, I'll wash out that mouth of yours--

00:02:28.022 --> 00:02:30.817
Always be aware
of your surroundings, asshole.

00:02:31.776 --> 00:02:34.028
I'm the one you're fighting.

00:02:34.112 --> 00:02:36.573
-Ryu!
-Stay back if you're scared, Horohoro.

